1y-wo-por

This repository contains original work and code adapted from the following
project, which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE):

  Phyrion, 1Y-Well-Ordering-Lean
  https://github.com/Phyrion1343/1Y-Well-Ordering-Lean
  revision 6533b2975f3cafb3582dc8f8127e9ea7144d7e69

Files adapted from it keep a header naming the original file and stating what
was changed.  No code from the snapshot vendored there as `vendor/bms`
(YesMetaZFC, bms-constructible-bridge), which carries no license, is copied or
adapted here; the mathematics it formalizes is re-implemented independently
where it is needed.

The model in Por/ is stated against the interface of
`OneY/RootIndexed/Representation.lean` (adapted from the project above).
Por/Tuple.lean, Por/Omega1.lean, Por/Relation.lean, Por/Closure.lean and
Por/Chain.lean adapt helpers and constructions of `lean/Pattern/Basic.lean`
and `lean/Pattern/Chain.lean` of koteitan/bms-elem-pattern
(https://github.com/koteitan/bms-elem-pattern), which is licensed under
CC BY-SA 4.0 by the same author as this repository; each of these files says
so in its header.  The author releases those parts here under Apache-2.0 as
well (decided 2026-09-23).

ZeroY/ and OneY/ (160 modules) are adapted from `formalization/ZeroY` and
`formalization/OneY` of Phyrion's project.  Each file starts with a header
naming its original path and revision and stating what was changed: the
imports and namespaces of the BMS layer are renamed to `Por.BMS`, a few
declarations that serve only the BMS well-foundedness corollary are removed,
and a few proofs that opened definitions of the BMS layer now use the lemmas
of Por/BMS instead.  `ZeroY/BMS/AnyArray.lean` is not included.

Por/BMS/ is written for this repository.  Its theorems carry the names and
statements the adapted core calls, taken from the call sites in the core; the
definitions and proofs are this repository's own formulation.  A line-by-line
comparison against the unlicensed snapshot finds no coinciding line in any
definition body or proof.
